    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moon Tropica is a free-to-play, top-down, hack and slash PVP fighter. Team up with, or play against friends using a wide array of powerful weapons in a variety of unique, dynamic maps.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A LEGEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/d3b46bebd14b19b027021044056ac6df.poster.avif?t=1749064888\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/d3b46bebd14b19b027021044056ac6df.webm?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/d3b46bebd14b19b027021044056ac6df.mp4?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the adventurous, energetic, heart-pounding battle arenas where strategy, skill, and determination are put to the ultimate test. Earn XP progression, complete quests, conquer challenges, and receive rewards all while customizing your fully dynamic character from head-to-toe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWERFUL ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/489e7c1a1550519b07fcb172b6010676.poster.avif?t=1749064888\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/489e7c1a1550519b07fcb172b6010676.webm?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/489e7c1a1550519b07fcb172b6010676.mp4?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By any means necessary! Open chests and loot your opponents for a variety of special weapons ranging from boomerangs, bows, elemental staffs, and the ever-so-powerful 'Zuka'. Strategically use objects and dynamic elements from around the map to eliminate your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXCITING GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/3ec54d717f8cc34af4e815c72e8d42e5.poster.avif?t=1749064888\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/3ec54d717f8cc34af4e815c72e8d42e5.webm?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/3ec54d717f8cc34af4e815c72e8d42e5.mp4?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend for yourself, eliminate all of the other opponents, and show them who's boss in the ultra fast paced Free-For-All, and 5 Lives game modes. If you're looking for more strategy, team up with friends and dominate the other team in Team Deathmatch and King Of The Hill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VIBRANT COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/7bdd42b3a7b25d43a295d699bb04cc67.poster.avif?t=1749064888\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/7bdd42b3a7b25d43a295d699bb04cc67.webm?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/7bdd42b3a7b25d43a295d699bb04cc67.mp4?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight and meet other players on the battlefield. Express yourself with a variety of emotes and utilize the\u00a0 seamless text chat. Whether you want to play solo, or with a group of friends, there is always a new experience that awaits.<br><br><strong>Disclaimer:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moon Tropica is currently in Early Access. Some advertised features shown in-game or in promotional materials are not yet available in the current build. These elements are presented for visual and illustrative purposes only and will be introduced as development progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following features are coming soon:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jeet Fest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Palm Haven</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Compatibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprays</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireworks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We appreciate your support and patience as we continue building the full Moon Tropica experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moon Tropica is a free-to-play, top-down, hack and slash PVP fighter. Team up with, or play against friends using a wide array of powerful weapons in a variety of unique, dynamic maps.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME A LEGEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/d3b46bebd14b19b027021044056ac6df.poster.avif?t=1749064888\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/d3b46bebd14b19b027021044056ac6df.webm?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/d3b46bebd14b19b027021044056ac6df.mp4?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the adventurous, energetic, heart-pounding battle arenas where strategy, skill, and determination are put to the ultimate test. Earn XP progression, complete quests, conquer challenges, and receive rewards all while customizing your fully dynamic character from head-to-toe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWERFUL ITEMS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/489e7c1a1550519b07fcb172b6010676.poster.avif?t=1749064888\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/489e7c1a1550519b07fcb172b6010676.webm?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/489e7c1a1550519b07fcb172b6010676.mp4?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By any means necessary! Open chests and loot your opponents for a variety of special weapons ranging from boomerangs, bows, elemental staffs, and the ever-so-powerful 'Zuka'. Strategically use objects and dynamic elements from around the map to eliminate your opponents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXCITING GAME MODES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/3ec54d717f8cc34af4e815c72e8d42e5.poster.avif?t=1749064888\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/3ec54d717f8cc34af4e815c72e8d42e5.webm?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/3ec54d717f8cc34af4e815c72e8d42e5.mp4?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend for yourself, eliminate all of the other opponents, and show them who's boss in the ultra fast paced Free-For-All, and 5 Lives game modes. If you're looking for more strategy, team up with friends and dominate the other team in Team Deathmatch and King Of The Hill.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VIBRANT COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/7bdd42b3a7b25d43a295d699bb04cc67.poster.avif?t=1749064888\" width=620 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/7bdd42b3a7b25d43a295d699bb04cc67.webm?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664890/extras/7bdd42b3a7b25d43a295d699bb04cc67.mp4?t=1749064888\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the fight and meet other players on the battlefield. Express yourself with a variety of emotes and utilize the\u00a0 seamless text chat. Whether you want to play solo, or with a group of friends, there is always a new experience that awaits.<br><br><strong>Disclaimer:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moon Tropica is currently in Early Access. Some advertised features shown in-game or in promotional materials are not yet available in the current build. These elements are presented for visual and illustrative purposes only and will be introduced as development progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following features are coming soon:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Shop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Career</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jeet Fest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Palm Haven</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Compatibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprays</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireworks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We appreciate your support and patience as we continue building the full Moon Tropica experience.</p>",
